WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:22.080
I wear makeup not because I feel like
I need it to be pretty or whatever,

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:27.400
I just use it because I like
to see what I can do with the hands.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.800
I just think it’s a lot of fun
just to experiment.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.960
Freedom to be creative
and see what I can do.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.600
When I went out and about
before these hands

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.600
and I was just walking
around with my arms,

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.040
people would always stare at them.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.720
They would come over to me
and ask what happened.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.640
And I had to repeat
the same story like:

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:04.160
"I got a really bad disease called
meningitis septicaemia, nearly died."

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:07.880
And it's just a really
negative topic of conversation.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.920
Whereas now with these hands,
when I go outside -

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.480
everyone who sees us
are excited by them.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:18.880
Feel free to play
with her hands Maurine.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:19.760
Can I?

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:21.440
Yeah, yeah look!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.800
That’s great, that really is.
It's fabulous!

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.960
It's more like, "Woah how did you get
these hands? How do I get some?

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.480
They're amazing.
You're like a superhero."

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.000
You can do thumbs up
as well can't you?

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.040
Yeah.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.880
Everyone's really excited by them,

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.840
rather than feeling sorry for me
all the time.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.240
And I like that so much better.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:53.960
There are muscle sensors inside
of the hands,

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.920
so you can actually control them
just by touching them.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.120
The sensors are connected
to my muscles.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:07.400
I squeeze my muscles
to close the hand.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.440
I flex to open.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.280
And then if I want to change the grip
then I can flex again.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.480
They definitely help me to multitask
so I am now able to like,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.520
pull a suitcase and hold
a hot chocolate and drink it.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:33.960
Dad look I've been practicing with
the hands and I can do a fist.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.080
Very nice!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:41.880
Having these hands you have the
freedom to have your independence,

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:45.360
like you can do what you want without
having to rely on other people.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.880
Look I've got... finger shadow.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.640
Aww. Your own little shadow.
That’s cute.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:58.960
I really hope that these hands
will be available on

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.800
National Health Service.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.560
These hands are
£10,000 a pair I believe.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.000
And that's a lot cheaper
than what we used to have.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:13.280
You know what, it's so heart-warming
just watching her like, doing that.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.320
This is what I mean, the simple
things that change your life.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.800
Simple stuff like holding
her hand or...

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.720
telling she's got
little finger shadows.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.000
It's so cute.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:35.600
I feel like my determination
has got me to where I am today.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.840
Impressive!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.120
The main goal is like...

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.960
ultimate independence just like
anybody else with hands can have.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.480
Because obviously I don’t want to
live with you forever, no offence.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.240
But I want to move out
and have my own house

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:57.600
and I want to be able
to do everything

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.600
that anyone with hands can do.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:03.040
So that’s the main goal in the long
run and I think we're definitely

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.720
not too far away from that.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:13.880
I think it will make everyone,
not just amputees, feel better

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.000
if everyone just stopped
judging each other

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:19.120
and just live your life
without being judged.

